	(text "Q5 conducts while VBUS is absent (its gate is on VBUS). Q4 and Q6 share PWR_GATE, which Q7 pulls low while PWR_EN (IO10) is high. The GPS daughterboard takes VDD3V3 from P8 (K3); its own nets stay apart, as no cable is published."
